{"type":"standard","title":"Scott Colom","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Scott Colom</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q115492489","titles":{"canonical":"Scott_Colom","normalized":"Scott Colom","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Scott Colom</span></span>"},"pageid":72007761,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1382219179","tid":"572d2dae-d1f4-11f1-8ce9-4dc08a7b625a","timestamp":"2026-10-27T10:51:19Z","description":"American lawyer (born 1982)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Scott_Colom"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Scott_Colom","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Scott_Colom"}},"extract":"Scott Winston Colom is an American lawyer and politician serving as district attorney for the 16th Judicial District of Mississippi. He is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Mississippi. He is a former nominee to serve as a United States district judge of the United States District Court for the Northern District of Mississippi.","extract_html":"<p><b>Scott Winston Colom</b> is an American lawyer and politician serving as district attorney for the 16th Judicial District of Mississippi. He is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Mississippi. He is a former nominee to serve as a United States district judge of the United States District Court for the Northern District of Mississippi.</p>"}